        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="Source: employee-dispatch.job.js and employee-dispatch.service.js. This is not a global expiry scan: elapsed invitations are excluded by query and expired as part of a later invite command. No invitation is sent for a shift that already started. Autonomous ranking is advisory; actual acceptance and occupancy are rechecked in UC-35." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
